        "node_id": "n_2_1cdb6c",
        "thought_text": "Iterate through possible values of x starting from the calculated average and check if they satisfy the distribution conditions by ensuring that the sum of pieces of each cake divided by the number of plates is less than or equal to x. If a valid distribution exists, update the result. Continue until the smallest possible x is found that meets the conditions.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_2_1cdb6c_0",
