        "node_id": "n_3_ba34c6",
        "thought_text": "Consider using a more detailed approach to ensure that the distribution respects the constraints and finds the optimal number of pieces per plate. Specifically, evaluate the possibility of distributing pieces of each cake separately and then determine the minimum pieces per plate while ensuring no plate contains pieces of both cakes.",
